+### 4. `IRxTexture` creation path (coordinator addition 4)
+
+`rx_api.h`: new `RxFormat` (`RX_FORMAT_RGBA8_UNORM`/`RX_FORMAT_RGBA8_SRGB`,
+same `typedef int32_t` + unnamed-`enum` shape as `RxResult`) and
